{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106120","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410612001:0":{"text":"이봐! 그쪽이 아니라, 이쪽이라고!","source_cn":"喂喂！方向错了，不是那边！是这边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3D5B013B89E5642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410612002:1":{"text":"아, 감사합니다.","source_cn":"好，多谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3098584D64EBDFBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410612003:1":{"text":"그... 그렇게 걷지만 말고 잠깐 쉬었다 갈까?","source_cn":"你……你先别闷头走了，要不要先休息一下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1269324FCD4D1FCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410612004:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410612005:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 인듀어를 저렇게 놔둬도 괜찮을까? 저렇게 계속 참기만 하면...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB00172DB82A5DDB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 인듀어를 저렇게 놔둬도 괜찮을까? 저렇게 계속 참기만 하면...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 인듀어를 저렇게 놔둬도 괜찮을까? 저렇게 계속 참기만 하면...","variant_male_record_index":"161492","variant_female_record_index":"161493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1410612005":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 인듀어를 저렇게 놔둬도 괜찮을까? 저렇게 계속 참기만 하면...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，这样不行吧？他一直这么憋着……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB00172DB82A5DDB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 인듀어를 저렇게 놔둬도 괜찮을까? 저렇게 계속 참기만 하면...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 인듀어를 저렇게 놔둬도 괜찮을까? 저렇게 계속 참기만 하면...","variant_male_record_index":"161492","variant_female_record_index":"161493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410612006:1":{"text":"그럼 난 뭐 잘할 것 같아?","source_cn":"我看着像很懂的样子吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x77AB42302A72CAC8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼 난 뭐 잘할 것 같아?","female":"그럼 난 뭐 잘할 것 같아?","variant_male_record_index":"161494","variant_female_record_index":"161495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410612009:1":{"text":"저는 경비병이 된 지 얼마 안 됐을 때, 항상 죄악화된 자를 처단할 때 머뭇거리곤 했습니다.","source_cn":"刚成为卫兵时，我对孽化者下手总是会犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81DC5F41F5DB1BF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410612010:1":{"text":"페리엘은 제게 너무 신중하다며, 더 과감해야 한다고 했지요... 그렇지 않으면 스스로만 상처받게 될 거라고요.","source_cn":"斐利尔会说我太过谨慎，应该更果断一些……不然自己容易受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8151EE201CF740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410612011:1":{"text":"페리엘은 제게 자신을 보호하는 법, 상처를 치료하는 법, 신념을 지키는 법을 가르쳐 주었습니다... 제게 그렇게 많은 것을 가르쳐 주었지만...","source_cn":"他教我保护自己，治愈伤痛，坚守信念……斐利尔教会了我那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2C15F9D29B2174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410612012:1":{"text":"단 한 번도... 친구를 잃은 고통을 받아들이는 법은 가르쳐 준 적이 없었습니다.","source_cn":"却从来没有教过我……该如何面对失去挚友的痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C94DB82C5CE876E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410612013:1":{"text":"휴, 이봐... 때로는 괜찮은 척하는 것보다, 한바탕 우는 게 나을 때도 있어.","source_cn":"唉，小子……有时候痛哭一场，比装作若无其事更好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x748423237D9A8DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410612014:1":{"text":"아닙니다... 적어도 지금은 안 됩니다. 페리엘이 목숨과 맞바꾼 진실이 바로 눈앞에 있으니...","source_cn":"不……至少现在不能。斐利尔用生命换来的真相就在前方——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F82E5A4569DCC7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410612015:1":{"text":"답을 찾기 전까지는 슬퍼할 시간이 없습니다.","source_cn":"在找到答案之前，我决不允许自己悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E839F720E735889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1410612015":{"text":"답을 찾기 전까지는 슬퍼할 시간이 없습니다.","source_cn":"在找到答案之前，我决不允许自己悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E839F720E735889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410612016:1":{"text":"...감사합니다. 저는 괜찮습니다. 이제 어디로 가면 되지요?","source_cn":"……谢谢，我没事。接下来要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49FD68E98CB82868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410612017:0":{"text":"...그냥 마음대로 가고 있던 거였어?! 휴, 내 제사장 꼬맹이를 봐서라도...","source_cn":"……原来你就是在闷头乱走！唉，看在祭司小子的面上——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7233628908CD7A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410612018:1":{"text":"가자, 페리엘이 본 진실이 뭔지 보여줄게.","source_cn":"走吧，我带你去见见斐利尔见到的真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4AB006BC1EEA46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"(그의 어깨를 가볍게 두드린다)","source_cn":"（拍拍他的肩膀）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4139FF9222BD85AF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(그의 어깨를 가볍게 두드린다)","female":"(그의 어깨를 가볍게 두드린다)","variant_male_record_index":"72024","variant_female_record_index":"